OL,3,GNEWSABoys, 12 and 14, arrested on
OL,4,Asuspicion of arson after major city
OL,5,Acentre fire
OL,6,
OL,7,FTwo boys, 12 and 14, have been arrested
OL,8,Fon suspicion of arson after a large
OL,9,Ffire at a "residential property" in
OL,10,FMarket Street
OL,12,FAt 22:55 BST on Monday night,
OL,13,FNottinghamshire Fire and Rescue Service
OL,14,Fsaid 12 fire engines were at the scene
OL,16,FA fire commander told BBC Nottingham
OL,17,Fthe blaze - in the Escobar building -
OL,18,Fspread to the roof
OL,20,FNo injuries have been reported,
OL,21,Faccording to the fire service
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
