OL,6,
OL,7,FA number of roads were closed while
OL,8,Ffirefighters dealt with the blaze, but
OL,9,Fhave since reopened, with traffic
OL,10,Frestrict to one lane
OL,12,FTrams are unable to run through the
OL,13,Fcity centre
